    anchor: sekcje Making an overall CERQual assessment of confidence (rys. 2) i Creating a CERQual Evidence Profile and a Summary of Qualitative Findings (SoQF) table
    revision: Implementation Science 13 (supl. 1), 2018
EVIDENCE_TYPE: SOURCE_FACT
